OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F391A1787935776
OL,3,CMackems will head to Milan after
OL,4,CSunderland draw AC Milan in Europa
OL,5,CLeague
OL,7,FSunderland will play against AC Milan
OL,8,Fat the San Siro as the Black Cats
OL,9,Fcompete in their first European
OL,10,Fcompetition in 53 years, it has been
OL,11,Fannounced.
OL,13,FThe draw for the first stage of the
OL,14,FEuropa League was held on Friday (28
OL,15,FAugust), with Sunderland finding out
OL,16,Ftheir eight opponents for the
OL,17,Ftournament's league stage.
OL,19,FThey will play four games at the
OL,20,FStadium of Light, as well as four
OL,21,Faway, including the trip to Milan.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G1/6
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,,,
