FL,392,420,250,120,000,100
PN,39102
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F391A1787935776
OL,3,CMackems will head to Milan after
OL,4,CSunderland draw AC Milan in Europa
OL,5,CLeague
OL,7,FOn Wearside, they will face Dutch
OL,8,Fleague leaders AZ Alkmaar, Dinamo
OL,9,FZagreb of Croatia, Polish side
OL,10,FJagiellonia Bialystok and Levski
OL,11,FSofia, one of five top-tiers teams in
OL,12,Fthe Bulgarian capital.
OL,14,FAs well as playing away against AC
OL,15,FMilan, Regis Le Bris' side will travel
OL,16,Ffor matches against Lech Poznan of
OL,17,FPoland, Belgian side Anderlecht and
OL,18,FTorreense from Portugal.
OL,26,@rD@PO|xD@_Rw
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G2/6
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,,,
