OL,24,ANext PageBNE Eng SportCReg RadioFRewind
FL,392,420,250,120,000,100
PN,39103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F391A1787935776
OL,3,CMackems will head to Milan after
OL,4,CSunderland draw AC Milan in Europa
OL,5,CLeague
OL,7,FThe exact dates of the fixtures will
OL,8,Fbe revealed in the days following the
OL,9,Fdraw.
OL,11,FTalking about the challenge that
OL,12,Fawaits his players, Regis Le Bris
OL,13,Fsaid: "We'll learn (the) new clubs,
OL,14,Fnew stadiums, new geography as well
OL,15,Fbecause it's new for Sunderland and
OL,16,Fthat's step by step so it'll take time
OL,17,Fto analyse those teams."
OL,19,FHowever, he insisted his focus is
OL,20,Fcurrently on the upcoming Premier
OL,21,FLeague game against Fulham.
OL,26,@uD@TpmuD@Xpn
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G3/6
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,,,
