PN,39104
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F391A1787935776
OL,3,CMackems will head to Milan after
OL,4,CSunderland draw AC Milan in Europa
OL,5,CLeague
OL,7,FThat match is the first league game of
OL,8,Fthe season at the Stadium of Light, as
OL,9,FSunderland look to pick up their first
OL,10,Fpoints following defeat away to
OL,11,FIpswich on the opening day.
OL,13,FThe Wearside outfit qualified for
OL,14,Ftheir first European cup in more than
OL,15,Fhalf a century after finishing 7th in
OL,16,Fthe league last season, with victory
OL,17,Fat home against Chelsea on the final
OL,18,Fday securing their spot in the
OL,19,Fcontinental tournament.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G4/6
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBNE Eng SportCReg RadioFRewind
FL,392,420,250,120,000,100
PN,39105
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F391A1787935776
OL,3,CMackems will head to Milan after
OL,4,CSunderland draw AC Milan in Europa
OL,5,CLeague
OL,7,FAs well as playing one of the biggest
OL,8,Fclubs in Europe in one the continent's
OL,9,Fmost iconic stadiums, the game against
OL,10,FAC Milan has taken on an extra
OL,11,Fsignificance for many Sunderland fans
OL,12,Fdue to the mocking song of "Have you
OL,13,Fever seen a Mackem in Milan?" sung by
OL,14,FNewcastle United fans during their
OL,15,Ftime in the Champions League.
OL,17,FAsked directly after the draw about
OL,18,Fwhen he first heard the song, Le Bris
OL,19,Fsaid "recently".
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G5/6
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBNE Eng SportCReg RadioFRewind
FL,392,420,250,120,000,100
PN,39106
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F391A1787935776
OL,3,CMackems will head to Milan after
OL,4,CSunderland draw AC Milan in Europa
OL,5,CLeague
OL,7,FHe added: "I don't want to speak about
OL,8,Fthat. It's more about us.
OL,10,F"We are proud of Sunderland first of
OL,11,Fall, and our fans deserve to be in
OL,12,Fthis position for their passion, for
OL,13,Ftheir connection with the club, their
OL,14,Fsupport and it's going to be a huge
OL,15,Fexperience. It's football so we want
OL,16,Fto be... competitive in that cup as
OL,17,Fwell."
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G6/6
